  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  LgNrmQ
  @  Quantile: the X below which the probability is p.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "LgNrmQ: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → μlv σlv pv « μlv 0 + σlv 0 + pv 0 + → μl σl p « '0' →Num 'EXP(μl+12*σl)' →Num 0 0 → lo hi x d « 1 40 START '(lo+hi)/2' →Num 'x' STO '(IFTE(x≤0;0;0.5*(1+erf((LN(x)-μl)/(σl*√(2))))))' →Num 'd' STO 'IFTE(d<p;x;lo)' →Num 'lo' STO 'IFTE(d<p;hi;x)' →Num 'hi' STO NEXT '(lo+hi)/2' →Num 'x' STO 1 2 START 'IFTE(ABS(IFTE(x≤0;0;1/(x*σl*√(2*Ⓒπ))*EXP(-((LN(x)-μl)^2)/(2*(σl^2)))))>0.000000000000000000000000000001;x-((IFTE(x≤0;0;0.5*(1+erf((LN(x)-μl)/(σl*√(2))))))-p)/(IFTE(x≤0;0;1/(x*σl*√(2*Ⓒπ))*EXP(-((LN(x)-μl)^2)/(2*(σl^2)))));x)' →Num 'd' STO 'IFTE((d>lo) AND (d<hi);d;x)' →Num 'x' STO NEXT x μlv σlv pv 3 →List Drop » » »
